    "body": "Looks like Bantam has a file to download here: https://support.bantamtools.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001671594-Fusion-360-Tool-Library \n\nDownload the tool library here: [Tool Library 0.3.zip](https://support.bantamtools.com/hc/article_attachments/115002419813/Bantam%20Tools%20Tool%20Library%200.3.zip)\n\nThis .zip archive contains two files: a .json file used in Fusion 360 and a .hsmlib file used for Inventor HSM and HSMWorks/HSMXpress.\n\nnote: the .hsmlib file is an xml file",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
