    "body": "Done by PR #466 (merged): the native tool-library format - export the document's tools as JSON and import that file back as one undoable command, refusing an insane tool by name and never overwriting a tool by name. Maintainer decision (2026-11-11) on the rest: no importer for the Autodesk tool-library formats (Fusion 360 .json, HSMWorks .hsmlib) - they sit too close to the clean-room rules. Manufacturers' published cutting data can be entered in the native format.",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
